      "content": "wait, did u just say \"not being haunted by mischievous goblins\"? lol what are you talking about? im just trying to fix my chocolate. anyway, you mentioned calcium lactate crystals earlier—is that what causes the white appearance, or is it actually just the cocoa butter fats moving around? i'm confused.",
